CONTRIBUTING to Kabeer's Docs
=============================

Thank you for your interest in contributing to Kabeer's Docs!
This is an open source project under GPL-3.0 license.

SETUP
-----
1. Fork the repository on GitHub
2. Clone your fork: git clone <your-fork-url>
3. Navigate to client@web directory
4. Install Bun runtime: https://bun.sh
5. Install dependencies: bun install
6. Start development: bun dev

CODE STYLE
----------
- Use TypeScript for type safety
- Follow existing code patterns
- Write clear, descriptive comments
- Keep functions and components small
- Use meaningful variable names

GIT WORKFLOW
------------
- Create feature branches from main
- Write clear commit messages
- Keep PRs focused on one feature
- Update documentation as needed
- Add tests for new features

ISSUES
------
- Report bugs with detailed steps
- Suggest features via GitHub issues
- Check existing issues first
- Include environment details
- Add screenshots if relevant

PULL REQUESTS
-------------
- Follow the template if provided
- Describe changes clearly
- Update README if needed
- Pass all tests before submitting
- Be responsive to feedback

COMMUNITY
---------
- Be respectful and inclusive
- Help other contributors
- Ask questions in issues
- Share your improvements
- Follow code of conduct

